  "description": "Xiippy.POSeComSDK.Light:1.3.0; Xiippy.ai's simplified lightweight SDK for POS and e-commerce systems. This package enables a POS system or an e-commerce system to trigger a privacy-preserving data-rich payment which includes a statement object that is delivered to the payer in a privacy-preserving fashion. This SDK interacts with Xiippy's SDKBridge which provides simplified localised interfaces and manages all the complex cryptographic and data delivery ops.",
